WEBVTT

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:04.900
1989, in high school. There I am, in the fashion of the day.

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:08.500
I think I was quite fashionable. Well, I tried, anyway.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:12.640
In Germany. It was a school trip.

00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:18.850
The first trip, that was it. We were there for four weeks,

00:00:18.850 --> 00:00:24.250
we saw the Berlin Wall, and I did not realize how much of a passion I had.

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:31.340
But that was then. We were in high school. I did know a passion was emerging.

00:00:31.930 --> 00:00:38.590
So, I realized that I have now traveled so much, and I want to help.

00:00:38.630 --> 00:00:45.550
I even ran a travel agency for a while, and I realized, wow,

00:00:45.550 --> 00:00:50.650
I can actually share my knowledge, help others.

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:56.140
With all the experience, I realized that I can help.

00:00:56.290 --> 00:00:59.990
And that's why I became a travel coach.

00:01:00.580 --> 00:01:06.500
I am a certified coach, so I have actually been trained on coaching.

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:12.230
And the difference is that while an agent would book just one trip for you,

00:01:12.290 --> 00:01:17.600
a coach leaves you able to book every trip after that.

00:01:17.600 --> 00:01:26.740
A one-time investment that enables you, empowers you, and enriches you for your very bright travel future.

